      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al final de ese sol, Tezcatlipoca bajó a hablar con un hombre, Tata, y su esposa, Nene.",
          "en": "At the end of that sun, Tezcatlipoca came down to speak to a man named Tata and his wife, Nene."
        },
        {
          "es": "Les dijo: \"Ahuequen un gran ahuehuete y métanse adentro.\"",
          "en": "He told them: \"Hollow out a great cypress tree and climb inside.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "\"Coman solo una mazorca de maíz cada uno, y nada más.\"",
          "en": "\"Each of you may eat one ear of maize, and nothing else.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Así lo cuenta la Leyenda de los Soles.",
          "en": "That is how the Legend of the Suns tells it."
        }
      ],
