        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Cuando por fin bajó el agua, el tronco quedó en tierra, y Tata y Nene salieron.",
          "en": "When the water finally went down, the log came to rest on land, and Tata and Nene climbed out."
        },
        {
          "es": "Vieron un pez. Tenían muchísima hambre.",
          "en": "They saw a fish. They were very, very hungry."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hicieron fuego frotando palitos, y asaron el pescado.",
          "en": "They made fire by rubbing sticks together, and roasted the fish."
        },
        {
          "es": "El humo subió hasta el cielo, y los dioses de las estrellas preguntaron: \"¿Quién está haciendo humo?\"",
          "en": "The smoke rose to the sky, and the star gods asked: \"Who is making smoke?\""
        }
      ],
